<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Roots of Madness</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #0d0d0d;
      color: #e0e0e0;
      font-family: monospace;
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .glitch {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      animation: glitch 1s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes glitch {
      0% { text-shadow: 2px 0 red; }
      20% { text-shadow: -2px 0 lime; }
      40% { text-shadow: 2px 2px blue; }
      60% { text-shadow: -2px -2px red; }
      80% { text-shadow: 2px -2px lime; }
      100% { text-shadow: 0 0 blue; }
    }
    a {
      color: #90ee90;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1 class="glitch">ROOTS OF MADNESS</h1>
  <p><em>This is the only record they couldn't scrub.</em></p>
  <p>They buried everything else. The names. The screams. The mycelium.</p>
  <p><a href="log1.html">Begin with the first recording.</a></p>
</body>
</html>
